&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin is the world’s leading platform for savings and investment products. Founded in 2012, the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;FinTech&lt;/strong&gt; connects consumers with banks in the EU, the UK and the US. This gives consumers &lt;strong&gt;better interest rates&lt;/strong&gt; and banks a &lt;strong&gt;diversified form of refinancing&lt;/strong&gt;. Our vision is to offer savings and investments without barriers and thus open up the global 160 trillion euro market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin currently employs more than 800 people from over 75 countries worldwide. Today, the platform holds over 80 billion euros in assets from&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;more than one million investors&lt;/strong&gt; which have accrued over 5 billion euros in returns.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;135&quot; data-end=&quot;472&quot;&gt;The Custody &amp;amp; Principal Broking team serves as the backbone of Raisin Bank’s Digital Wealth Management (DWM) division, providing the secure, scalable foundation essential for retail investing. We manage the complex infrastructure, from securities trading mechanics to outsourcing oversight that ensures operational resilience and regulatory compliance. As our retail customer base grows, we are focused on continuous process optimization and high-volume scalability, ensuring our platforms remain reliable, secure, and fully compliant with BaFin standards. We are currently seeking a Senior Operations Manager to join this mission.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Process Optimization: &lt;/strong&gt;You will drive the evolution of operational workflows to ensure they are scalable and resilient, directly supporting high-volume retail growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Controls &amp;amp; Oversight:&lt;/strong&gt; You will define and execute the control framework for daily securities processing, ensuring rigorous validation of all outsourced clearing and settlement activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regulatory Compliance:&lt;/strong&gt; You will partner with Compliance, Legal, and Risk teams to navigate the regulatory landscape and maintain strict adherence to German financial regulations (including KWG, WpHG, and MaRisk).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Resilience:&lt;/strong&gt; You will proactively investigate, moderate, and resolve complex securities discrepancies and trade breaks in close collaboration with cross-functional internal and external stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Due Diligence &amp;amp; Auditing:&lt;/strong&gt; You will actively support due diligence activities and comprehensive audits for both current and prospective outsourcing partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Project Contribution:&lt;/strong&gt; You will provide subject matter expertise for internal and external strategic initiatives, including product launches, platform upgrades, and system migrations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Finance, Economics, Business Administration, or a completed banking apprenticeship (Bankkaufmann/-frau) with relevant further qualifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 7+ years of operations experience within a custodian bank (Depotbank), clearing firm, or retail broker in the German/European market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Private Customer Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Direct experience with mass-affluent and high-volume retail accounts, managing the complexities of fractional shares, and savings plans (Sparpläne).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical &amp;amp; Market Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep understanding of Clearstream Banking Frankfurt (CBF), T2S, and European post-trade infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Risk &amp;amp; Controls:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven background in establishing and executing internal controls, particularly within the context of MaRisk and outsourced operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Business fluency in&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;English&lt;/strong&gt; is required; good German language skills is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join our mission, join our team – and grow with us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Raisin, we care about each other and it is one of our top priorities to foster an open and caring environment in which everyone feels welcome and comfortable. Our culture is strongly driven by our ambitious team, which connects more than 75 different nationalities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of our team, you will benefit from:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Development Budget of €2,000 and four full training days per year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours, home office and 30 vacation days.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A company pension scheme (Betriebliche Altersvorsorge), which we support with 20%.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy more than 50+ different sports with Urban Sports Club: We subsidize your membership with more than €20 per month.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Do you miss being in the office? The Deutschland Ticket gets you there, which we subsidize with €25 per month.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Love cycling? With JobRad, lease the bike of your choice and enjoy tax savings, plus Raisin covers your monthly insurance costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hungry all the time? Snacks, daily fresh fruit as well as drinks provided at the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are moving from another country or city to join us? We may support your relocation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.raisin.com/corporate/raisin-applicant-privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Raisin Applicant Privacy Policy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;728&quot; data-end=&quot;900&quot;&gt;We value diversity and the unique experiences each individual brings. If you’re excited about this role but don’t meet every requirement, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;907&quot; data-end=&quot;1013&quot;&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for everyone, regardless of race, colour, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, or gender identity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;To further strengthen our Legal Department in Munich, we are looking for an experienced, pragmatic and business-oriented &lt;strong&gt;Senior Legal Counsel (f/m/d) – Commercial Law&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will take ownership of the drafting, review and negotiation of a broad range of national and international commercial agreements across the Agile Robots Group. You will work closely with our Business, Engineering, Procurement and Management teams, providing practical legal advice on commercial transactions and projects involving robotics, hardware, software and industrial automation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will report to the Legal Director Germany and join our Legal team in Germany, currently comprising four members. You will also collaborate with five additional Legal Counsel across the group internationally. This is a full-time, permanent position based in Munich, with the option to work remotely one day per week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Responsibilities:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently draft, review and negotiate a broad range of complex national and international commercial agreements, including supply, procurement, sales, service, cooperation, development, licensing, software and technology agreements as well as NDAs, taking ownership from initial instruction through negotiation and execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise on complex project-related contracts and support cross-functional teams throughout the entire project lifecycle, including Proof-of-Concept and Proof-of-Technology projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Address IP-related provisions in commercial, technology and development agreements, particularly licensing and the allocation of intellectual property rights, in collaboration with colleagues specializing in IP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted legal business partner for internal stakeholders across multiple jurisdictions and international group companies, proactively identifying legal and commercial risks and developing pragmatic solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support legal matters across the group&#39;s international subsidiaries and acquired businesses, collaborating with other members of the Legal team on cross-functional matters as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain the group&#39;s commercial template library, negotiation playbooks and contracting processes together with internal stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your profile:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a fully qualified German lawyer (&lt;em&gt;Volljurist&lt;/em&gt;) with strong academic credentials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have at least five years of post-qualification experience, including relevant experience in commercial contract law gained at a leading international law firm. Previous in-house experience, whether through an in-house role or a substantial secondment, is highly desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have substantial hands-on experience drafting, reviewing and negotiating complex commercial agreements and are comfortable independently leading negotiations with sophisticated counterparties.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience advising technology, software, hardware or industrial businesses, including IP-related contractual matters such as licensing and the allocation of intellectual property rights, is an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have excellent drafting, negotiation and communication skills, take ownership of your work and provide pragmatic, commercially oriented advice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You combine professional excellence with a down-to-earth attitude, a sense of humor and a collaborative mindset, and are happy to support colleagues beyond your immediate area of expertise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are fluent in German and English and comfortable negotiating sophisticated commercial agreements in both languages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItemName___Q0F_7 TranslationField-module__aboutUsWrapper___WXJpq&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;A dynamic high-tech company, combined with financial soundness and world-class investors.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Join an interdisciplinary, international team with 60+ different nationalities in a collaborative work environment.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Lots of development opportunities as we continue to grow.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Challenging tasks and impactful projects alongside experts that enable professional and personal growth.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Corporate Benefits Program covering health, mobility, and learning for 100€ net per month.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Modern office facilities with a rooftop terrace overlooking Munich, free drinks &amp;amp; fruits, and regular company events contribute to a good working environment&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agile Robots&lt;/strong&gt; is a leading provider of AI-powered robotics solutions. By combining artificial intelligence and robotics, the company makes industries smarter, more flexible, and more efficient.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in Munich in 2018 by renowned robotics researchers from the German Aerospace Center (DLR), Agile Robots has experienced rapid global growth. Today, more than 3,500 highly skilled robotics and AI enthusiasts are employed worldwide. The company has one of the largest research and development teams in the AI and robotics industry.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Agile Robots has built a unique portfolio; together with the subsidiaries BÄR Automation, Franka Robotics, idealworks, and Krause Automation, the company covers all areas of AI-driven robotics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more at: &lt;a id=&quot;menur58p&quot; class=&quot;fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn&quot; href=&quot;https://www.agile-robots.com/en/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://www.agile-robots.com/en/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;L’IA ne transforme pas une entreprise parce qu’elle est disponible, mais parce que les collaborateurs s’en emparent pour travailler autrement. Chez Artefact, nous sommes des makers : “We Make AI Work”. Notre métier n’est pas de commenter l’IA, c’est de la faire fonctionner, au cœur des métiers et à grande échelle.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Et tout commence par vous.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;En tant qu’AI Builder Manager, vous pilotez des missions et programmes AI Adoption qui font passer l’IA de l’expérimentation à la transformation des métiers. Au contact des dirigeants et des responsables métiers, vous définissez des dispositifs de montée en compétences, de construction d’agents et d’accompagnement au changement. Vous êtes le moteur de nos missions : vous en garantissez la qualité, l’impact et la rentabilité, faites grandir vos équipes et développez vos comptes aux côtés des Directeurs et Partners.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Vous partez des défis des utilisateurs métiers, de leurs processus et de leurs irritants pour transformer les possibilités de l’IA en résultats tangibles. Vous restez un maker : vous ne vous arrêtez pas au slide. Vous concevez des expériences d’apprentissage engageantes, challengez et construisez des solutions IA fonctionnelles (no-code, low-code, vibe coding), et mobilisez les équipes pour faire passer ces solutions du prototype à des usages durables.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Vous accompagnez les organisations dans la transformation des tâches, des rôles et responsabilités, et des compétences à l’ère de l’IA. Vous articulez les initiatives de terrain (bottom-up) avec les programmes de transformation à grande échelle (top-down), en collaboration avec nos équipes AI Strategy et Engineering. Votre ambition : faire de l’IA un levier de transformation du travail, avec un impact concret, mesurable et durable sur les équipes et leur performance.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Activités &amp;amp; Responsabilités&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;I. Analyse &amp;amp; Cadrage&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Conduire le cadrage avec L&amp;amp;D, RH, sponsors et métiers: définir populations cibles, priorités, objectifs observables et parcours différenciés.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Concevoir une stratégie de démultiplication combinant sessions, contenus digitaux, coaching, champions et transfert aux équipes internes.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Piloter un portefeuille de cas d&#39;usage opérationnels: valeur, faisabilité, risque, capacité de build et séquencement des sprints.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Organiser les ateliers de discovery et faire arbitrer les points de dépendance, d&#39;accès ou de gouvernance par les interlocuteurs habilités.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;II. Développement &amp;amp; Déploiement des Solutions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Piloter budget, planning, staffing, qualité pédagogique et satisfaction ; réaliser les arbitrages nécessaires et faire grandir les équipes.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Superviser les assets pédagogiques, animer les sessions à forte visibilité et garantir l&#39;alignement entre exercices, capacités des plateformes et besoins métier.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Superviser les solutions low-code/no-code, les standards, les jeux de tests, la documentation et les quality gates adaptés au périmètre technique et aux standards de la practice.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Concevoir avec les Analytics Engineers l’architecture de reporting d’un programme, définir les standards de visualisation et de KPIs, coacher les équipes en data storytelling, superviser leurs dashboards et en piloter l’adoption.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;III. Adoption &amp;amp; Animation de Communauté&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Coordonner la mise en usage, la formation des utilisateurs et le handover client: relais managériaux, communautés, rituels et office hours.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Piloter les boucles de feedback, les indicateurs de valeur et, si désigné, le plan de change sur une mission ciblée.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;IV. Structuration&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;et Pilotage de la démarche Change&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Définir des indicateurs de compétences, d&#39;autonomie et d&#39;usage; restituer les résultats aux sponsors et ajuster la démarche.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Contribuer aux avant-ventes, estimations, chiffrages et propositions, en identifiant les extensions pertinentes chez les clients.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Qualifier la nécessité d’un co-delivery avec Solutions Engineering ou la DSI, sans empiéter sur leurs autorités techniques.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profil recherché&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Vous vous reconnaissez si…&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; vous aimez piloter des missions exigeantes de bout en bout, faire grandir une équipe et gagner la confiance de dirigeants, et si vous préférez mettre une démo entre leurs mains plutôt que leur décrire une vision&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;5 à 8 ans d’expérience en conseil, transformation digitale, data / IA ou conduite du changement, avec une formation supérieure de niveau licence ou master issue d’un cursus académique d’excellence.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Une expérience confirmée de pilotage de missions complexes et de management d’équipes, avec une responsabilité sur la qualité des livrables, les délais, les budgets et la satisfaction client.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Une solide maîtrise des usages de l’IA générative et agentique, et un état d’esprit de maker : capacité à concevoir, challenger et faire évoluer des agents et solutions IA fonctionnelles (no-code, low-code, vibe coding), et à guider les équipes dans leur construction.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Une expérience dans la conception et le pilotage de dispositifs de montée en compétences et de programmes d’adoption de l’IA, ainsi que dans la transformation des processus, des rôles et des pratiques de travail.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Une aisance dans la relation avec des interlocuteurs de haut niveau, la capacité à fédérer les parties prenantes, faire grandir les consultants et contribuer au développement commercial.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Une maîtrise parfaite du français et de l’anglais (oral et écrit).&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;À propos d’Artefact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Artefact est un cabinet de conseil spécialisé en data et en intelligence artificielle, qui accompagne les entreprises pour transformer ces technologies en impact business concret et mesurable. À la croisée du conseil, de la data et de la technologie, nos 2 500 collaborateurs dans 27 pays mettent leurs expertises en commun pour concevoir, développer et déployer des solutions qui répondent aux enjeux de transformation de nos clients.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Notre accompagnement s&#39;étend sur l&#39;intégralité de la chaîne de valeur : &lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Strategize AI&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; (cadrage stratégique, opportunités à fort impact, trajectoires, modèles opérationnels), &lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Deploy AI&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; (ingénierie, industrialisation, architectures agentiques, produits data) et &lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Adopt AI &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;(conduite du changement, acculturation, usage quotidien de l&#39;IA).&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Envie d&#39;en savoir plus ? Découvrez Artefact, nos expertises et notre culture : &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.artefact.com&quot;&gt;https://www.artefact.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pourquoi nous rejoindre?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;De la stratégie à la réalisation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ne pas s’arrêter aux recommandations : participer à la conception et à la concrétisation de solutions IA répondant à de véritables enjeux métiers.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Une collaboration entre expertises&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Occuper un rôle à la croisée de l&#39;humain (AI Adoption), de la stratégie (AI Strategy), de la technologie (AI Engineering).&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Piloter ce qui compte&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Des missions de transformation IA de bout en bout, au cœur des enjeux des grands groupes, avec une vraie autonomie, une équipe à faire grandir et des comptes à développer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Une trajectoire qui accélère&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Un parcours clair vers Senior Manager puis Directeur, dans un environnement d’apprentissage continu axé sur la transmission des connaissances et le pragmatisme technologique.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Processus de recrutement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un &lt;strong&gt;entretien de fit RH &lt;/strong&gt;(30 / 45’) avec les RH / Talent Acquisition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un &lt;strong&gt;entretien de fit expert &lt;/strong&gt;(60’) avec un AI Builder Senior ou Manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une &lt;strong&gt;présentation d’un cas réel &lt;/strong&gt;(60’) sur lequel le candidat a travaillé par le passé avec un AI Builder Director&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un &lt;strong&gt;role play AI Adoption Manager&lt;/strong&gt; (45 / 60’) AI Builder Director ou un AI Builder Partner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un &lt;strong&gt;entretien de fit final &lt;/strong&gt;(30’) avec un AI Builder Partner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rémunération : &lt;/strong&gt;66 000€ à 75 000€ brut annuel (fixe) + 10 000€ de variable, selon expérience et séniorité&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Chez Artefact, nous sommes convaincus que la diversité des parcours, des expériences et des perspectives fait la richesse de nos équipes. Nous nous engageons à offrir un environnement inclusif et des opportunités équitables, où chacune et chacun peut évoluer et exprimer pleinement son potentiel. Nos recrutements reposent sur les compétences, le potentiel et l&#39;adéquation avec le rôle.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT QUINCE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Quince is a destination for builders, creators, innovators, and operators who want to come together and challenge the status quo. Our mission is simple: make really high quality essentials for really low prices, fairly and sustainably. We deliver on that mission through a unique manufacturer-to-consumer (M2C) model eliminating the layers of traditional retail that add cost and result in consumers paying more than they need to. We find, build relationships with, and work directly with the manufacturing partners behind some of the world’s finest products. From there, our teams design smart, efficient operational processes&amp;nbsp; and build and deploy proprietary technology, AI, and analytics to help us scale fast.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What began with a small assortment of elevated basics has quickly grown into a cross-category brand spanning apparel, accessories, home goods, and more. Today, tens of millions of people across a growing number of countries come – and return – to Quince because they trust us to deliver.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR CULTURE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Quince is a culture built for builders by builders. Our way of working starts with a blank sheet of paper. We question conventional thinking, use technology and data to uncover new opportunities, and move quickly to turn ideas into reality. We aren’t interested in replicating how others do retail. We’re building a better way – at a speed and scale unlike anything that’s been done before.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We dream big and chase the hard problems others shy away from. Rejecting long-held assumptions is part of our company&#39;s DNA.&amp;nbsp; Where conventional wisdom says you have to choose – soft or durable, speed or rigor, quality or price – we ask why that trade-off has to exist in the first place.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our pace is fast and the bar is high because our customers expect a lot from us and we refuse to let them down. We believe the best results come from challenging ourselves, learning from one another, and building on each other&#39;s strengths.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Here, responsibility is not determined by role, tenure, or seniority. Every team member - no matter their level - has the opportunity to drive our business and shape our trajectory.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re someone who likes to imagine new possibilities and build better systems rather than plug-in to outdated ones, Quince is the place for you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2290&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6a0d0d38-3057-4834-9012-12f09f19e465&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#0747a6&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;THE ROLE&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Senior Manager, CRM Lifecycle + Journeys&lt;/strong&gt; owns every triggered flow in the customer journey across email, SMS, push, and in-app for UK, Germany, and France. You will build the automation engine that runs Quince&#39;s retention programme: from the welcome series a UK customer sees the day we launch, to the win-back flow that recovers a French customer six months later.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a builder role. You will spend most of your first six months in Iterable and the CDP. You will write the flow logic, set up the data pipes, design the experiments, and ship the AI agents that take work out of building, testing, and reporting on flows. The Director, CRM owns the retention strategy and the campaign calendar. You own the triggered flow programme that runs alongside it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Two constraints shape this job. UK and EU privacy rules mean the US lifecycle playbook does not transfer unchanged: you will rebuild the identity-resolution layer and shift weight toward logged-in and app behaviour. Channel economics also differ across markets, with SMS in particular materially more expensive in Europe than in the US, so the sequencing of email, SMS, push, and in-app per flow per market is not the same as the US default.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be joining a team that values speed, candor, and rigour. This role is for you if you like building things, you can hold a roadmap in one hand and a SQL query in the other, and you have an opinion on how AI changes lifecycle work over the next 18 months.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2663&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e0c03b8d-8a8f-42ae-b3e9-26b5a2308ae6&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#0747a6&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, launch, and own every triggered lifecycle flow for UK (July 2026), DE (October 2026), and FR (November 2026): welcome, browse abandon, cart abandon, post-purchase, low stock, back in stock, win-back, replenishment, care instructions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with MarTech to Ship AI agents and tooling that take work out of flow build, copy, segmentation, and QA. Target at least one end-to-end CRM agent in production by EoY1 and a 50% reduction in flow concept-to-deployment time within 90 days.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Data team to run the triggered-flow testing roadmap with statistically sound design. Minimum 6 A/B tests per quarter per flow per market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build channel-cost decision logic across email, SMS, push, and in-app per flow per market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recover signal lost from fingerprinting and consent restrictions in UK/EU by pushing app and logged-in routing for non-consenting users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stand up and run the localisation pipeline with freelance copywriters for EN-UK, DE, and FR. Localised flow content live before each market launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with tech team to maintain CDP quality across UK/EU: data model, integrations (Iterable, Attentive, app SDK, site events), data hygiene, latency, and identity-resolution accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2753&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9ae6a13b-2175-4a37-a4c2-5839b2f592ae&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#0747a6&quot;&gt;Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2769&quot; data-local-id=&quot;46937c2f-d543-4fbd-b76c-3593c6541fb4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#0747a6&quot;&gt;Required: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years lifecycle/CRM marketing in DTC or ecommerce, including at least 3 years owning automated/triggered flows end to end (not campaign/blast).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on with Iterable (preferred), or comparable ESP (Braze, Klaviyo, SFMC). Must have built flows in the tool, not just briefed them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on with a CDP: Segment, mParticle, Hightouch, Census, or similar. Must understand identity resolution and data hygiene.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has built or deployed AI agents or LLM workflows in a marketing context (copy, segmentation, flow logic, QA). If you have not shipped one yet, you can describe the one you would ship in your first 90 days here.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SQL proficient. Can self-serve in Looker, Lookr, or BigQuery without waiting for an analyst.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A/B testing rigour. Knows what statistical significance means and where it breaks in lifecycle (sample size, primary metric selection, novelty effects).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of UK/EU privacy law (GDPR, PECR) and consent management. Understands what changes operationally when fingerprinting is restricted.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail-oriented. Triggered flows live or die on edge cases (locale, currency, time zone, opt-in state, suppression rules).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-functional operator. Will work daily with creative, brand, data science, tech, and US CRM counterparts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3083&quot; data-local-id=&quot;dbaae2d5-3e8d-43bb-be8c-e1c7e3b63382&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#0747a6&quot;&gt;Preferred:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;20322c78-4bdc-4d7a-af35-387a22f0e7ab&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#0747a6&quot;&gt;Multi-market lifecycle experience (UK + DE or FR), fashion or home goods background, app-native lifecycle experience, fluency in DE or FR.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3319&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;WHY QUINCE?&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3352&quot;&gt;Joining Quince means being part of a mission-driven team reshaping retail. You will work alongside talented colleagues, tackle meaningful challenges, and contribute to building a more sustainable, accessible future for customers and partners alike.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3604&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;EQUAL OPPORTUNITY &amp;amp; HIRING INTEGRITY&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3662&quot;&gt;Quince provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applications for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran or military status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4074&quot;&gt;Quince is committed to providing reasonable accommodations to qualified individuals with disabilities. If you need a reasonable accommodation to complete your application or to perform the essential functions of a role at Quince, please let us know by completing &lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/DpJ11jHa1WbqfUWB9&quot;&gt;this accommodation form&lt;/a&gt;. We review all requests individually and will work with you to determine appropriate accommodations on a case-by-case basis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4428&quot;&gt;Employment is contingent upon successful completion of a background check. Quince will conduct background checks in compliance with applicable federal, state, and local laws.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4604&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Security Advisory: Beware of Frauds&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4641&quot;&gt;At Quince, we&#39;re dedicated to recruiting top talent who share our drive for innovation. To safeguard candidates, Quince emphasizes legitimate recruitment practices. Initial communication is primarily via official Quince email addresses and LinkedIn; beware of deviations. Personal data and sensitive information will not be solicited during the application phase. Interviews are conducted via phone, in person, or through the approved platforms Google Meets or Zoom—never via messaging apps or other calling services. Offers are merit-based, communicated verbally, and followed up in writing. If personal information is requested to initiate the hiring process, rest assured it will be through secure and protected means.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5364&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;Notre domaine Sport Products recherche un·e Quality Engineer firmware IoT en CDI basé·e à Lille.&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;L&#39;équipe &quot;Augmented Products&quot; est au cœur de l&#39;innovation chez Decathlon. Notre mission ? Concevoir une stack technique complète, de l&#39;objet connecté au Cloud, pour offrir une expérience sportive augmentée à nos utilisateurs mondiaux. Composée d&#39;experts passionnés, notre équipe relève des défis technologiques majeurs liés à la scalabilité et à la fiabilité des données. En nous rejoignant, vous aurez un impact direct sur la manière dont des millions de sportifs interagissent avec leurs produits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;TA FUTURE CONTRIBUTION&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tu conçois et déploies les stratégies de test automatisé et manuel pour valider la qualité et la fiabilité des firmwares IoT pour différentes catégories de produits et diverses architectures matérielles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tu crées, exécutes et maintiens le référentiel des tests firmware (BLE, WiFi, LTE, CAN, OTA) sur bancs de test et environnements réels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tu identifies, qualifies et suis la résolution des anomalies en étroite collaboration avec les équipes de développement firmware et produit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tu garantis la conformité de la télémétrie, des services GATT et des protocoles de communication avec les spécifications établies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tu participes à l&#39;amélioration continue des processus QA et promeus la culture de la qualité au sein de l&#39;équipe pluridisciplinaire.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tu participes à la définition et la promotion d’une approche Shift-Left en intégrant les exigences de testabilité dès la phase de conception et de cadrage des fonctionnalités avec les équipes Produit et Firmware.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tu conçois, construis et fais évoluer les outils, frameworks et bancs d&#39;essai d&#39;automatisation des tests pour réduire le besoins d’action manuelles, l&#39;instabilité et la dépendance au matériel physique.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;CE QUE NOUS T’OFFRONS&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organisation de travail hybride ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Matériel fourni en accord avec tes missions et nos engagements sociétaux (Mac ou Windows) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une équipe de projet locale au sein d&#39;un réseau mondial (possibilité de carrière internationale) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Développement des compétences et accompagnement (diversité des projets, formations internes et externes, etc.) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Package de rémunération (actionnariat salarié, bonus mensuels/trimestriels).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;NOTRE ENGAGEMENT EN FAVEUR DE L&#39;INCLUSION ET DE L&#39;ACCESSIBILITÉ&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez Decathlon, nous reconnaissons l&#39;immense valeur qu&#39;apporte la diversité à nos équipes et nous nous efforçons continuellement de favoriser et de cultiver un lieu de travail inclusif et équitable : c&#39;est pourquoi l&#39;Inclusion est l&#39;un de nos Fondamentaux Humains. Nous encourageons les personnes de tous horizons et de toutes capacités à postuler, car nous sommes convaincu·es que la diversité des pensées, des cultures, des identités et des expériences vécues nous rend plus fort·es. Decathlon s&#39;engage également à offrir un processus de sélection inclusif et accessible à tous les candidat·es. En cas de besoin d&#39;aménagement, tu peux en faire la demande via le formulaire de candidature, celle-ci sera confidentielle. Ces demandes n&#39;affectent pas le résultat du processus de recrutement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Imaginez si la technologie nous permettait de repousser les frontières et d&#39;offrir des expériences sportives inédites. C&#39;est précisément notre ambition chez Decathlon Digital ! Nous sommes une équipe de plus de 5 000 experts en ingénierie logicielle, gestion de produits, données, cloud et cybersécurité, répartis à Paris, Lille et Amsterdam. Ensemble, nous créons la plus vaste plateforme sportive numérique, en exploitant les innovations technologiques pour optimiser la chaîne de valeur, concevoir des expériences connectées et donner une seconde vie à nos produits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changeons la donne pour de bon.&lt;/strong&gt; Notre passion du sport nous guide et nous voulons qu’elle perdure. C’est pourquoi nous nous engageons à bâtir un modèle technologique plus durable, en réduisant notre impact direct sur l&#39;environnement, et en créant un espace sûr et inclusif pour apprendre et nous épanouir ensemble. Rejoins l’équipe et façonnons le futur du sport.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Airbnb was born in 2007 when two hosts welcomed three guests to their San Francisco home, and has since grown to over 5 million hosts who have welcomed over 2 billion guest arrivals in almost every country across the globe. Every day, hosts offer unique stays and experiences that make it possible for guests to connect with communities in a more authentic way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The community you will join:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Airbnb is looking for a Marketing &amp;amp; CRM intern to join the Experiences team in Paris for a 6-month internship.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work directly with the person in charge of Demand for Paris Experiences, alongside Marketing, Growth and Product Management partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experiences let guests step into the real life of a destination: cook with a local chef, explore a hidden neighborhood with a historian, discover Paris through the eyes of the people who live there. Paris is one of our most iconic and competitive markets, and our job on the Demand side is to make sure the right guests find the right Experience at the right moment, whether they are visiting Paris or live nearby.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a curious, organized and data-friendly student who loves the craft of CRM and Operational Marketing: a sharp brief, a well-built email, a smart audience, and an analysis that tells us what to do next. You are comfortable juggling several campaigns at once, working with different teams, and turning numbers into clear recommendations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The difference you will make:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will support the Paris Experiences Demand lead on the day-to-day CRM and marketing activity that drives bookings. You will see a campaign from the first brief to the final analysis, and you will own your own projects along the way. During your internship, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Run email campaigns end to end&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write briefs for email campaigns (audience, objective, key messages, timing) and coordinate with copy, design and CRM partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute campaigns through our internal tools and planning process, including setup, QA and send follow-up&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze results after each send (opens, clicks, bookings, incrementality) and share clear learnings and next steps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Support listing promotion and audience targeting&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze cohorts of guests (new vs. returning, local vs. traveler, International vs Domestic) to understand behavior over time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build simple, readable dashboards and recurring reports to select and prioritize listings based on quality, availability, performance and fit with the campaign&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Market and Supply teams to make sure what we promote is bookable and best-in-class&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn insights into concrete recommendations for audiences, timing and messaging&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Follow local activations&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide operational support and follow-up on field campaigns such as flyering, partnerships, events or more: briefing, logistics, timing, partners and results tracking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help measure what works locally and recommend future iterations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The intern experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an intern, you will be part of a team where you contribute to real projects with real business impact. Your manager, your team and our wider employee community will strive to be superhosts to you during your internship. We provide the support, mentorship and hands-on experience you need to learn quickly and make an impact.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll get a front-row seat on how a global marketplace builds demand for a destination, with real ownership from day one: your campaigns go live and your analyses shape decisions. You’ll do it alongside a team that cares about craft, curiosity and human connection. You can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Marketing, Market Management and Acquisition partners to deliver projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present your analyses and recommendations to stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Seek and give feedback throughout the internship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take part in the Experiences and broader Airbnb community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your expertise:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Current student or recent graduate&lt;/strong&gt; (degree completed within the last 12 months) from a leading business school, engineering school or equivalent program in France, looking for a 6-month internship starting in January 2027&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluent in French and English&lt;/strong&gt;, with excellent written communication: you can write a clear brief and a clear recap. You also have an eye for great copy and for what makes a message feel human&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A strong interest in marketing, CRM or growth&lt;/strong&gt;, and in travel, hospitality or community-driven products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curious about data and performance metrics&lt;/strong&gt;, with an interest in using insights and quantitative analysis to evaluate campaigns, track performance, and inform decision-making. Experience with Claude or other AI tools to work faster and smarter is a must-have.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Highly organized and detail-oriented&lt;/strong&gt;, able to manage several campaigns and deadlines in parallel, and to follow up until everything is done&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A collaborative mindset &lt;/strong&gt;and the confidence to work with people across teams, from Marketing to Product to Operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must have work authorization for France. Visa sponsorship is not available for this position&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your location:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Due to the nature of this position, the successful applicant will need to be based in Paris, France to be able to conduct their work. Interns can expect to spend half of their time at the office and half working remotely with exact dates as agreed upon by the hiring manager. Additional in-person attendance for team meetings or offsites may be required as needed. Please note we are unable to provide relocation or visa sponsorship for this position.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our commitment to inclusion &amp;amp; belonging:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Airbnb is committed to working with the broadest talent pool possible. We believe diverse ideas foster innovation and engagement, and allow us to attract creatively-led people, and to develop the best products, services and solutions. All qualified individuals are encouraged to apply.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;How We&#39;ll Take Care of You:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The base pay range shown below is annualized, is subject to change and may be modified in the future.&amp;nbsp; This role may also be eligible for benefits and Employee Travel Credits.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;France Annual Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€25.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€25.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reasonable Accommodations:&lt;/strong&gt; We are committed to providing reasonable accommodations throughout the recruitment process for applicants with disabilities. If you need assistance, or an accommodation, please let your recruiter know once you are contacted about a role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Note on Recruiting Scams:&lt;/strong&gt; Scammers sometimes pose as Airbnb recruiters to get money or personal information from candidates. A few things that will always be true for Airbnb’s hiring process: our open roles are posted on Airbnb’s Career’s Page at careers.airbnb.com, and our recruiters correspond only from @&lt;a href=&quot;http://airbnb.com&quot;&gt;airbnb.com&lt;/a&gt; or @&lt;a href=&quot;http://ext.airbnb.com&quot;&gt;ext.airbnb.com&lt;/a&gt; email addresses. Our recruiters will never ask for your Social Security number, bank account details, passport, or payment app information while you are interviewing.&amp;nbsp; We’ll also never ask you to pay a fee, send money, deposit or cash a check, or purchase work-related equipment (such as a company laptop) during the interview process. We encourage candidates to remain vigilant of these recruiting scams and not share sensitive information if you do not believe an individual is actually affiliated with Airbnb.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who is Artefact?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Artefact is a next-generation strategy and data consulting firm that transforms organizations through data and AI. With 1,800+ consultants, data scientists, and engineers across 23 countries, we work with global leaders such as Samsung, L’Oréal, Orange, and Sanofi. From our Lausanne and Zurich offices, we help leading Swiss and international companies turn data and AI into measurable results, working with the leading data platforms, including Databricks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Main Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You will design and deliver the data platforms our clients run their business and their AI on, combining hands-on engineering with client advisory.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build modern data platforms:&lt;/strong&gt; End-to-end lakehouse architectures, mainly on Databricks, built for reliability, observability, and cost.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineer pipelines:&lt;/strong&gt; Batch and streaming pipelines with Python, Spark, and SQL, with data quality built in.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Migrate and modernize:&lt;/strong&gt; Move legacy warehouses and ETL to the cloud, from assessment to cut-over.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make data ready for AI:&lt;/strong&gt; Governed data products and semantic layers that analytics and AI agents can rely on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run it properly:&lt;/strong&gt; Data governance, CI/CD, infrastructure as code, monitoring, and cost control.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advise and support:&lt;/strong&gt; Translate business needs into roadmaps, coach junior engineers, and support proposals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Engineer first, consultant second, with a track record of shipping to production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in data engineering, including hands-on Databricks experience in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert Python and SQL, with strong Spark and data modeling skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Databricks Data Engineer Professional certification, or a commitment to obtain it within 6 months (we support you).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience on Azure, AWS, or GCP, plus DataOps (Git, CI/CD, Terraform, testing).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong consulting skills: requirements gathering, documentation, stakeholder management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English plus French or German (both is a plus); eligible to work in Switzerland.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience with other data platforms (Snowflake, Microsoft Fabric, BigQuery), dbt, MLOps, and industry experience (consumer goods, pharma, logistics, insurance, manufacturing).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy with a Data Edge:&lt;/strong&gt; Build the platforms behind boardroom priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Swiss Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; High visibility from day one on flagship programs, working directly with senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong Tech Ecosystem:&lt;/strong&gt; Certified peers across Artefact and close partnerships with leading data and cloud platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth and Culture:&lt;/strong&gt; Certifications, training, international missions, and a team of doers who move fast and support each other.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you don’t meet 100% of the criteria, we still want to hear from you. Tell us about your passion, curiosity, and impact.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

